# Development Secrets Template
# Copy this file to each Worker directory as `.dev.vars` and fill in the values
# NEVER commit the actual `.dev.vars` file to git!

# ===========================================
# Ingestion API (packages/ingestion-api/.dev.vars)
# ===========================================
# ADMIN_API_KEY=your-dev-api-key-here

# ===========================================
# Health Monitor (packages/health-monitor/.dev.vars)
# ===========================================
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your-dev-bot-token-here
# TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=your-dev-chat-id-here

# ===========================================
# Instructions
# ===========================================
# 1. Copy this file to the Worker directory:
#    cp .dev.vars.example packages/ingestion-api/.dev.vars
#
# 2. Uncomment and fill in the relevant secrets for that Worker
#
# 3. Run wrangler dev to test locally
#
# For production secrets, use:
#    wrangler secret put SECRET_NAME